# Example ReRDMFT input file: Ne, cc-pVDZ, FUNCTIONAL PCCD, FULL_OPTIMIZATION.
# pCCD (Occ_opt/pCCD.h + Hessian_opt/PccdFock.h): t-/z-amplitude equations solved at the
# HF orbitals, then FULL_OPTIMIZATION macro-iterates ADAM orbital rotations (fixed
# occupations) and amplitude re-optimization (fixed orbitals) to convergence.
# No frozen core (PCCD_FROZEN_PAIRS defaults to 0): converged energy -128.5596739 Hartree,
# matching the literature oo-pCCD/cc-pVDZ reference for the Ne atom (-128.559674 Hartree)
# to ~1e-7 Hartree.
NELEC 10
BASIS ne-cc-pvdz.gbs
NON_RELATIVISTIC TRUE
FUNCTIONAL PCCD
FULL_OPTIMIZATION TRUE
CHOLESKY FALSE

GEOMETRY
Ne  0.000000   0.000000   0.000000
END
